# Tuy chinh kernel cho FPT AX3000CV2 (WF-810DF, IPQ5018)
#
# File nay duoc CHEN vao cuoi target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/config-default
# truoc khi build (buoc 6c). Dong o day ghi de cau hinh mac dinh cua ImmortalWrt.
#
# Cu phap (giong .config cua kernel):
#   CONFIG_XXX=y                  bat, build lien vao kernel
#   CONFIG_XXX=m                  build thanh module (goi kmod)
#   # CONFIG_XXX is not set       tat
#
# Moi dong o day deu duoc kiem tra lai sau khi build (buoc 10b): neu kernel
# that su KHONG nhan gia tri do (vd thieu phu thuoc) thi build bao loi,
# khong ra firmware "tuong da sua ma chua sua".
#
# Truoc khi them dong nao: xem file kernel-config-wf810df.txt trong Releases
# cua lan build truoc de biet gia tri hien tai. Moi thay doi ghi kem ly do
# va bang chung (dmesg may that, datasheet...) ngay tren dong do.
#
# Phan cung WF810DF (CV2): IPQ5018 2 nhan A53, Wi-Fi 2.4G tich hop + QCN6102 5G,
# switch Motorcomm YT9215S (MDIO1, SGMII 1000M), NAND GD5F2GM7RE 256 MB.

# --- Chua co thay doi nao: lan build dau dung de lay cau hinh kernel goc ---
